# Build context for the API image (Dockerfile at the repo root). Keep data, secrets,
# caches, notes and the frontend OUT of the image: data and the serving artifact are
# mounted at run time (compose.app.yaml), never baked in or copied here.
.git
.venv
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.vscode
.DS_Store
data
mlruns
mlartifacts
models
notebooks
project-notes
frontend
tests
docs
*.md
compose*.yaml
*.code-workspace
